---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Privacy Policy & SMS Terms | Star Martial Arts";
const description = "How Star Martial Arts collects and uses information, and the terms for our optional text messages.";
const schema = [];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} image="/images/hero.webp" schema={schema} pageClass="pg-privacy">
<section class="sec"><div class="w pv" style="max-width:820px"><p class="bc"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy &amp; SMS Terms</p><h1 class="d" style="font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);margin:14px 0 8px">Privacy Policy &amp; SMS Terms</h1><p><b>Star Martial Arts</b>, Gainesville, Florida (“StarMA,” “we,” “us”). Effective date: November 2, 2026.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you submit a form, request a tour, or contact us, we collect the information you give us, such as your name, phone number, email address, your child’s age, grade, and school, your preferred location, and any questions you share.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use your information to respond to your inquiry, schedule tours and trials, provide program and enrollment information, and operate our programs. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
<h2>Text messaging (SMS) terms</h2><ul><li><b>Program:</b> Star Martial Arts text messages. If you opt in, we may text you about your inquiry, tour or trial scheduling, reminders, and program information.</li><li><b>Consent:</b> Texting is optional. You opt in by checking the box on our forms. Consent to receive texts is not a condition of any purchase or enrollment.</li><li><b>Frequency:</b> Message frequency varies.</li><li><b>Cost:</b> Message and data rates may apply.</li><li><b>Opt out:</b> Reply <b>STOP</b> at any time to stop receiving texts. Reply <b>HELP</b> for help.</li><li><b>Help:</b> Call West Gainesville at 352-505-1499 or North Gainesville at 352-672-6356, or email westgv@mystarma.com or northgv@mystarma.com.</li><li><b>Carriers:</b> Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li></ul>
<h2>Mobile information is not shared</h2><p>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties. We may share information with service providers who help us operate our website, forms, and messaging, and only as needed to provide those services.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask us to update or delete your information, or stop messages at any time, by contacting your location using the details above.</p>
<h2>Children’s privacy</h2><p>Our website is intended for parents and guardians. Information about children is provided by their parent or guardian for the purpose of responding to inquiries and enrolling in our programs.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Star Martial Arts, 500 NW 60th St, Suite A, Gainesville, FL 32607 · 5000 NW 34th Blvd, Suite 5, Gainesville, FL 32605.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
